    "body": "Hi\r\n\r\nI am unable to use a personnal Data privacy usage notice.\r\nStep to reproduce:\r\n- in admin>options>security, I add a personnal Data privacy usage notice in the text area.\r\n- in admin>options>plugin>comment_form, I add the field 'Data usage confirmation'\r\n- in the front end, I went to comment_form, and then the texte remains with default value: 'By using this form you agree with the storage and handling of your data by this website.'\r\n\r\nAnd btw, I don't understand why this 'Data privacy usage notice' field is not multilingual.\r\n\r\nIn the same way, I add a custom page url for Data privacy policy page and add a custom link text, but I don't have a link displayed in comment_form.\r\n\r\nIn the same way too, I don't understand why this 'custom link text' field is not multilingual.\r\n\r\nOf course, the issue is the same with contact_form and register_user, so I think the issue is dealing with new options and functions for GDPR compliance.",
